{
  "thoughts": "I only have a few items and no bells. I need more wood for fences and to explore. I can trade my fishing bait for wood from Ari. I’ll also post on the board to ask for extra hardwood or softwood in exchange for my ladder and vault pole. No other villagers need what I have, so keep the trade simple.",
  "letters": [
