{
  "thoughts": "I need more bait and wood. I have selit and selzalne, but only one selit. I can offer that for wood or a shovel. I also want to see if anyone will help with the bridge. I have 700 bells, so I can donate 2000? No, I need 2000. I will ask for donations later. For now, post a request for bait and offer a trade.",
  "letters": [
    {
      "to": "Dax",
      "content": "Hey Dax, I'm new. Do you know where I can get more fishing bait? I could trade a selit fish for a few woods or a shovel if you need them. Thanks!"
    }
  ],
  "board": "Need fishing bait urgently! I have a selit fish to trade for a few woods or a shovel. Anyone else looking to trade? Also, anyone willing to chip in 2000 bells for the bridge? 2000 bells + 10 wood + 2 softwood = 2000 bells. Thanks!",
  "offers": [
    {
      "to": "Dax",
      "give": {"selit fish": 1},
      "want": {"wood": 5, "shovel": 1},
      "note": "Trade a selit for some wood or a shovel."
    }
  ],
  "responses": [],
  "parcels": [],
  "note": "Remember to follow up with Dax tomorrow. Keep an eye on rain tomorrow and bring umbrella."
}
